== Economy ==
The Gross District Domestic Product (GDDP) of the district is {{INRConvert|73276|c|abbr=on}} and it contributes 14% to the [[Gross State Domestic Product of Indian states|Gross State Domestic Product (GSDP)]]. For the FY 2013–14, the [[per capita income]] at current prices was {{INRConvert|124162}}. The [[Primary sector of the economy|primary]], [[secondary sector of the economy|secondary]] and [[tertiary sector of the economy|tertiary sectors]] of the district contribute {{INRConvert|6300|c|abbr=on}}, {{INRConvert|21654|c|abbr=on}} and {{INRConvert|45321|c|abbr=on}} respectively.<ref name="apedb">{{cite web|title=Economy of Visakhapatnam District|url=http://apedb.gov.in/infrastrctr.html|website=Andhra Pradesh Economic Development Board|access-date=25 April 2017}}</ref> The major products contributing to the [[Gross value added|GVA]] of the district from agriculture and allied services are, [[sugarcane]], [[paddy field|paddy]], [[Betel|betel leaves]], [[mango]], [[milk]], [[meat]] and [[Fishery|fisheries]]. The [[Gross value added|GVA]] to the industrial and service sector is contributed from [[manufacturing]], [[construction]], minor minerals, software services and unorganised trade.<ref name="apedb" />

